    "No? Thought so…  \p"
    "I'm Alejandra, I'm in the band The \n"
    "Warning with my sisters, I play bass. \p"
    "… … … \p"
    "Wanna spar to pass the time? $"
    "We're also big fans of The Last Dinner \n"
    "Party. \p"
